# Campaign run-control markers, not evidence: the wrapper rewrites both on
# every launch (`rm -f .DONE`, `echo $$ > campaign.pid`), and what they say
# is already in campaign-run.log, which IS committed.
docs/superpowers/evidence/*/.DONE
docs/superpowers/evidence/*/campaign.pid
